  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1TI 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Qualifications for Overseers and Deacons",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Here is a trustworthy saying: Whoever aspires to be an overseer desires a noble task.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the overseer is to be above reproach, faithful to his wife, temperate, self-controlled, respectable, hospitable, able to teach,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not given to drunkenness, not violent but gentle, not quarrelsome, not a lover of money.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He must manage his own family well and see that his children obey him, and he must do so in a manner worthy of full",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "respect.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(If anyone does not know how to manage his own family, how can he take care of God's church?)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He must not be a recent convert, or he may become conceited and fall under the same judgment as the devil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He must also have a good reputation with outsiders, so that he will not fall into disgrace and into the devil's trap.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the same way, deacons",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "are to be worthy of respect, sincere, not indulging in much wine, and not pursuing dishonest gain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They must keep hold of the deep truths of the faith with a clear conscience.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They must first be tested; and then if there is nothing against them, let them serve as deacons.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the same way, the women",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "are to be worthy of respect, not malicious talkers but temperate and trustworthy in everything.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A deacon must be faithful to his wife and must manage his children and his household well.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Those who have served well gain an excellent standing and great assurance in their faith in Christ Jesus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Reasons for Paul's Instructions",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Although I hope to come to you soon, I am writing you these instructions so that,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "if I am delayed, you will know how people ought to conduct themselves in God's household, which is the church of the living God, the pillar and foundation of the truth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beyond all question, the mystery from which true godliness springs is great:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "1TI 3:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "He appeared in the flesh,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "1TI 3:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "was vindicated by the Spirit,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "1TI 3:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "was seen by angels,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "1TI 3:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "was preached among the nations,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "1TI 3:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "was believed on in the world,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "1TI 3:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "was taken up in glory.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
